+## First-dungeon statuses (#359)
+
+Static pass over the export plus the move list in [`move-effects.md`](move-effects.md). **No runtime check was run in this pass**, so no duration here is newly runtime-verified, and the "Done when" is not met for statuses without an earlier runtime sample.
+
+**P1 list.** Statuses the 26 moves can cause: paralysis, burn, sleep, cringe, sure-shot class values 2 and 4, bide class `0xC`, leech seed. Stat stages are in the move handlers. Confusion, poison, nightmare, napping and yawning have no move in the list. The dungeon's traps were **not** read: the trap list and handlers are open (lead).
+
+| Status | Setter | Duration | Tag |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| Paralysis | `021885A0` | `0x9C` from the paralysis range, setter adds 1 | blue-verified static; no runtime sample |
+| Burn | `0218A710` | `0x7F` sentinel | blue-verified, runtime (#191 P1) |
+| Sleep | `0218B2D0` then `0218B420` | roll on `0219CF28` | blue-verified, runtime (#191 P1 / #190) |
+| Cringe | `021887E0`: `0xAC = 1`, `0xAD = roll + 1` | range word `DAT_02188904` not read | setter blue-verified static; duration lead |
+| Sure-shot 2 | `0218D778`: `0xC4 = 2`, `0xC5 = turns + 1`, turns passed by caller | caller rolls (1, 6) per move-effects | setter blue-verified static; effect of value 2 not read (lead) |
+| Sure-shot 4 | `0218D5F0`: `0xC4 = 4`, `0xC5 = roll + 1`, no Safeguard gate | roll inside the call | blue-verified static; reader is `CalcDamage` `0217BD94` |
+| Bide `0xC` | `0218E428` (#189 P1) | pool as in move-effects | blue-verified static |
+| Leech seed | `0218DAE4` (#166) | `0xC1 = roll + 1` | blue-verified static |
+
+Two rows of the move-effects table look wrong and are **lead**: Disable (`03B`) running the paralysis body, and Thunder Wave's `(1, 2)` draw being the paralysis turn roll rather than an accuracy draw.
+
+**Yawning write.** `0218ADA8(user, target, turns)` runs `CannotSleep` first. From `0x99 == 0` it writes `0x99 = 4` and `0x9A = turns`, then calls `0213F6C4` and `0217ADF8(target, 8)`. From other values it only shows a message. The wrapper `0215E0C0` passes `0219CF28(...) + 1`. blue-verified static.
+
+**Wake on hit.** `0217D5FC` calls the wake `0218F1EC` only for `0x99` in 1, 3, 5 **and** `0x9A == 0x7F`. `0218F21C` also handles petrified, then wakes only `0x99 == 1` with `0x9A == 0x7F`. So by static reading a hit does not wake a counted sleep (Hypnosis). blue-verified static; runtime check open.
+
+**Helpers (P4).** All blue-verified static; the names are leads.
+- `021818D0(e)`: true when `0x99` is 1, 3 or 5. Name: `IsSleeping`.
+- `02181904(e)`: 1 when any negative status is set (`0x99` in 1, 3, 4; `0x9B`; `0xA0` not 0 or 5; `0xAC`; `0xB3` 1 or 2; `0xB8` = 1; `0xC4` = 2; `0xC9` 1 or 2; `0xCB` = 1; `0xD2`; `0xDA`; move-slot flags; speed-down counters). Name: `HasNegativeStatus`.
+- `021805B0(e, bit)`: tests `1 << bit` against the IQ-skill bitfield of the monster info. Name: `HasIqSkill`.
+
+**P3 (RNG in the tick chain).** By the depth-2 walk and the setters read, the chain itself has no `DungeonRandInt` call except Shed Skin. The expiry routines can: yawn end rolls (4, 8); nightmare end; decoy end and `+0xC7` case 2 via `0217AF58`. Sleep, paralysis and cringe ends have none in the walk. blue-verified static; a runtime hook is open.
+
+**Still open for the Done-when:** runtime duration samples for paralysis, cringe, focus energy, smokescreen, leech seed and rage; per-turn effect and end condition reads for paralysis, cringe, value 2, rage and leech seed; the trap list.
